    "summary": "**Advance rolls** and **Charge rolls** get +1 for your **BLOOD ANGELS INFANTRY CHARACTER** units, though not for **COMMANDER DANTE** units.\n\nThis is a **GRACE** **Detachment**, and an army may include only one **Detachment** with that tag. The only Chapter whose **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units may join an army using this Detachment is **BLOOD ANGELS**.",
